          "text": "@Premium    @XSupport @X @Safety @elonmusk \n\nDear X Support Team\n\nMy account @hanlianyi331 has been permanently suspended without any specific reason provided. I believe this is an error caused by an automated system mistakenly flagging my recent posts.\n\nI am the legitimate owner of this account and a real person. My two most recent posts were purely academic discussions on:\n- Pedophilia in the context of psychiatric medicine (mental health perspectives)\n- Global laws and measures for preventing child sexual abuse\n\nThese posts were educational and focused on prevention, mental health understanding, and legal protections for children. They did not promote, glorify, or encourage any form of child exploitation or illegal activity in any way. They were intended to raise awareness on important public health and child protection topics.\n\nI fully support X's policies against child sexual exploitation and have always complied with the Community Rules. This appears to be a false positive by the AI moderation system.\n\nI kindly request a **human review** of my account and the specific posts in question. Please reinstate my account as soon as possible, as this account is important to me for sharing academic and educational content.\n\nThank you for your time and assistance.\n\nBest regards,  \n@hanlianyi331  \n\n#XAppeal #FalseSuspension"
        },
